    {"type":"text","id":"s7_x","x":820,"y":1745,"width":780,"height":30,"strokeColor":"#fecaca","text":"✗ the set still reads unhealthy, but the summary names no pod · structural\n  (illustration: two pods answer, one holds an error)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":297016},

    {"type":"line","id":"div4","x":40,"y":1800,"width":1560,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[1560,0]],"strokeColor":"#64748b","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":298001},
    {"type":"text","id":"pat_h","x":40,"y":1816,"width":400,"height":15,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","text":"PATTERNS IT INSTANCES","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":298002},
    {"type":"text","id":"pat_t","x":40,"y":1838,"width":1560,"height":30,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"[06] Calibrated Degrees of Freedom: seal state is parsed by code, not judged by the model reading raw output — the low-freedom choice, undone by the two halves being written against different shapes\n[16] The Permission Ladder: the generate-not-run rung is held by code; the unseal commands sit on the same rung as the reads, so the ladder's levels are flattened in the output","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":298003},
    {"type":"text","id":"missing","x":40,"y":1888,"width":1560,"height":45,"strokeColor":"#fecaca","text":"deliberately missing: one output shape (a generator whose commands print their own marker, or a parser that recognises each status table without one)\n· the pod list from the cluster (the replica count, so a scaled set is judged against itself)\n· an exit code (non-zero when unhealthy, so the validation runner [28] or a person could gate on it)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":298004},
    {"type":"text","id":"proto","x":40,"y":1948,"width":1560,"height":30,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"prototype: generates commands for a fabricated three-pod store and parses three fabricated captures — unmarked, marked, and a healthy four-pod set —\nso the format mismatch and the fixed count show on one screen · HA mode and version parsing are left out; they change no finding","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":298005}
  ],
